{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tinker Shot is a turned based spell building roguelike. You explore a world and tackle enemies by launching crafted spells at them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/extras/d08f8f25ad0408cd2b97a71e9f4b61b5.poster.avif?t=1761803121\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/extras/d08f8f25ad0408cd2b97a71e9f4b61b5.webm?t=1761803121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/extras/d08f8f25ad0408cd2b97a71e9f4b61b5.mp4?t=1761803121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is filled with a lot of emergent gameplay and forces players to fight in multiple unique ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/extras/967c3f472b45994f6ce2d93da1799cac.poster.avif?t=1761803121\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/extras/967c3f472b45994f6ce2d93da1799cac.webm?t=1761803121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351280/extras/967c3f472b45994f6ce2d93da1799cac.mp4?t=1761803121\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are able to create a diverse amount of whacky and broken spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store